| 8 GB | ~$2.50 | ~$13.5 |
| 16 GB | ~$3.50 | ~$14.5 |
| 32 GB | ~$5.00 | ~$16.0 |
| 64 GB | ~$8.00 | ~$19.0 |
| 128 GB | ~$13.00 | ~$24.0 |
| 256 GB | ~$22.00 | ~$33.0 |

Only 8–16 GB eMMC stays near the sub-$15 target — the honest cost of integrated flash, and exactly why offering microSD *and* eMMC is smart. Requires BGA assembly (CM with reflow + ideally X-ray).

